' ======================== INHERITANCE RELATIONSHIPS ========================
User <|-- Patient
User <|-- Doctor
User <|-- Receptionist
User <|-- Administrator

' ======================== COMPOSITION RELATIONSHIPS (STRONG OWNERSHIP) ========================
' COMPOSITION: Patient owns PatientRecord (1:1)
Patient "*" --* "1" PatientRecord : owns

' COMPOSITION: Doctor owns Schedule (1:1)
Doctor "1" --* "1" Schedule : owns

' COMPOSITION: Schedule owns TimeSlot (1:0..*)
Schedule "1" --* "0..*" TimeSlot : owns

' COMPOSITION: MedicalRecord owns Prescription (1:0..*)
MedicalRecord "1" --* "0..*" Prescription : contains

' COMPOSITION: Report owns ReportData (1:1)
Report "1" --* "1" ReportData : contains

' COMPOSITION: Administrator owns Announcement (1:0..*)
Administrator "1" --* "0..*" Announcement : publishes

' ======================== AGGREGATION RELATIONSHIPS (WEAK OWNERSHIP) ========================
' AGGREGATION: Department employs Doctor (1:0..*)
Department "1" o--* "0..*" Doctor : employs

' AGGREGATION: Appointment generates MedicalRecord (1:0..1)
Appointment "1" o-- "0..1" MedicalRecord : generates

' AGGREGATION: Appointment reserves TimeSlot (1:1)
Appointment "1" o-- "1" TimeSlot : reserves

' AGGREGATION: Patient submits Feedback (1:0..*)
Patient "1" o--* "0..*" Feedback : submits

' AGGREGATION: Administrator creates Backup (1:0..*)
Administrator "1" o--* "0..*" Backup : creates

' AGGREGATION: Administrator generates Report (1:0..*) 
Administrator "1" o--* "0..*" Report : generates

' ======================== ASSOCIATION RELATIONSHIPS (INDEPENDENT) ========================
' ASSOCIATION: Patient books Appointment (many-to-many through appointments)
Patient "1" -- "0..*" Appointment : books

' ASSOCIATION: Doctor conducts Appointment (many-to-many through appointments)
Doctor "1" -- "0..*" Appointment : conducts

' ASSOCIATION: Patient treated by Doctor (many-to-many)
Patient "0..*" -- "0..*" Doctor : treatedBy/treats

' ASSOCIATION: MedicalRecord created by Doctor
Doctor "1" -- "0..*" MedicalRecord : creates

' ASSOCIATION: Doctor belongs to Department (many-to-one)
Doctor "0..*" -- "1" Department : belongsTo

' ASSOCIATION: Receptionist registers Patient (many-to-many)
Receptionist "0..*" -- "0..*" Patient : registers

' ASSOCIATION: Receptionist manages PatientRecord (many-to-many)
Receptionist "0..*" -- "0..*" PatientRecord : manages

' ASSOCIATION: Administrator responds to Feedback (many-to-many)
Administrator "0..*" -- "0..*" Feedback : responds

' ASSOCIATION: Administrator oversees Department (one-to-many)
Administrator "1" -- "0..*" Department : oversees

' ASSOCIATION: Administrator configures BillingSetting (one-to-many)
Administrator "1" -- "0..*" BillingSetting : configures

' ASSOCIATION: Appointment references MedicalRecord for details
Appointment "1" -- "0..1" MedicalRecord : generates

note right of User
  Abstract base class for all users
  Provides authentication and profile management
  Inherited by Patient, Doctor, Receptionist, Administrator
end note

note right of Patient
  Extends User
  Owns PatientRecord (COMPOSITION)
  Has Appointments and MedicalRecords (AGGREGATION)
  Many-to-many relationship with Doctors
end note

note right of Doctor
  Extends User
  Owns Schedule and TimeSlots (COMPOSITION)
  Conducts Appointments (ASSOCIATION)
  Belongs to Department (ASSOCIATION)
  Many-to-many relationship with Patients
end note

note right of Administrator
  Extends User
  Publishes Announcements (COMPOSITION)
  Creates Backups and Reports (AGGREGATION)
  Oversees Departments and Billing Settings (ASSOCIATION)
  Responds to Feedback (ASSOCIATION)
end note

note right of PatientRecord
  COMPOSITION owned by Patient
  Permanent patient information
  Cannot exist independently
  Retained as per HIPAA compliance
end note

note right of Schedule
  COMPOSITION owned by Doctor
  Manages doctor's working schedule
  Contains TimeSlots for appointments
  Tracks time off dates
end note

note right of TimeSlot
  COMPOSITION owned by Schedule
  Basic time unit for appointments
  Can be booked or available
  Contains date and time information
end note

note right of Appointment
  ASSOCIATION class
  Links Patient, Doctor, and TimeSlot
  Generates MedicalRecord (AGGREGATION)
  Independent of other entities
end note

note right of MedicalRecord
  COMPOSITION owned by Patient
  AGGREGATION with Appointment
  Contains Prescriptions (COMPOSITION)
  Created by Doctor (ASSOCIATION)
  Legal requirement: permanent storage
end note

note right of Department
  AGGREGATION contains Doctors
  Doctors can transfer departments
  Overseen by Administrator
  Can have a Head Doctor
end note

note right of Report
  AGGREGATION created by Administrator
  Contains ReportData (COMPOSITION)
  Can be exported in multiple formats
  Tracks hospital statistics
end note

note right of Feedback
  AGGREGATION submitted by Patient
  ASSOCIATION with Administrator response
  Can be anonymized
  Tracks service quality
end note

@enduml
